! ============================================================
! RT02 — データプレーンは構築済み(変更不可)。AAA は未設定。
! ============================================================
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.2.0.2 255.255.255.255
interface Ethernet0/0
 description === to RT01 ===
 ip address 10.1.12.2 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
!
router ospf 1
 router-id 10.2.0.2
 network 10.2.0.2 0.0.0.0 area 0
 network 10.1.12.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
!
! --- 緊急用ローカル管理者(サーバ全断時の最後の砦) ---
username emg-admin privilege 15 secret Emg-9883
!
ip ssh version 2
